flowchart TD

%% -------- INITIAL STATE --------
    A[Observation Submitted] --> B[Care Instruction Row Created]
    B --> C[Shown in 'Not Acknowledged' Tab]

%% -------- TASK CREATION --------
    C --> D[Nurse Creates Task]
    D --> E[Task Linked with Order ID]
    E --> F[Move Row to 'Acknowledged' Tab]

%% -------- UPDATE EVENT --------
    F --> G{Observation Updated?}

%% -------- NO UPDATE --------
    G -->|No| H[No Change]

%% -------- UPDATE FLOW --------
    G -->|Yes| I["Care Instruction Updated\n(v1 → v2)"]

    I --> J[Do NOT Modify Existing Task]
    J --> K[Do NOT Recreate / Cancel Task]

    K --> L["Trigger Visual Indicator\n(Blue Blink) in Care Instruction Row"]
    L --> M["Nurse notices updated care instructions"]

%% -------- OPTIONAL ACTION --------
    M --> N["Nurse may decide to take action or not"]
    N -->|Take Action| O["Create or Cancel Task if required"]
    N -->|No Action| P["Continue with Existing Task"]

%% -------- END --------
    O --> T[Task Execution Continues]
    P --> T
    H --> T